            "keyPoints": [
                "Path: log in → Developers in the left sidebar → API Keys tab → create key",
                "The full key is shown only once; afterwards you see just the name and last 4 characters",
                "Keys are restricted by default: pick scopes, set a credit limit, optionally allowlist IPs",
                "Send the key in the xi-api-key header; never expose it in browser or app code",
                "In the Voice Library, pick a language first — the Accent filter then appears",
                "Use-case tags include narration, conversational, characters, news and meditation",
                "Stack only 2–3 filters: too many at once can return zero voices",
                "Legacy Default voices expire 31 December 2026, so test replacements early",
                "Free plan output has no commercial license — Starter is the minimum for monetized content"
            ],
